# The example extension's list (examples/extensions/open-tasks), installed in the empty home by
# tests/drive.rs, which also adds an overdue task to Inbox/Seismograph.md. The palette runs
# open-tasks.list, and cold-lava draws the list the extension sends: x ticks the seismograph
# task (the extension edits it and sends the list again without it), Enter opens a task's note
# at its line, Ctrl-o comes back to the list, and Esc closes it, which the extension hears.
size 140x30
env COLD_LAVA_EDITOR=none
env COLD_LAVA_TODAY=2026-11-07
wait-for ☐ 7 open tasks
keys :
type list the open
wait-for list the open tasks by note
keys enter
wait-for ↑↓ move · x tick · ⏎ open · h/l fold · / filter · t due today · Esc close
expect Open tasks
expect ▾ Inbox/Seismograph  1
expect ▾ Inbox/Field Season  3
expect ☐ Check the seismograph
expect 2026-11-01
expect ▾ Journal/2026-11-05  3
screen
keys j j j j j x
wait-for 6 rows
expect ☐ 6 open tasks
expect-not Check the seismograph
keys G enter
wait-for Journal/2026-11-05  reading
wait-for Ctrl-o ⟵ open-tasks
keys ctrl+o
wait-for Write a note on lahars
expect Open tasks
keys esc
wait-for closed the list of open tasks
screen
keys q
exits 0
